{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac281f8a929d436eb3baad045bd795c9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_17f9fe8bdbaf8fabdd791d99a2f0240b16778a36032e105d64a449388136ebc8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"agentmd/agent.md@e86e5c8b57d5 snapshot d9bd0b2eecce1b16","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_27ba52204e86f8e8f0a1f6d3316719030f2e6e0809148d16bb82a65564982fc9","slc_6ecda447a24b5985742a08c93bbff883a475a37b513d456fd76927b0020fb1c3"],"source_ids":["src_f322e22946775c708d663f0f3ce14dea"],"text":"The format is intended to be human-readable while remaining parseable by agentic coding tools, positioning one file as a universal voice for any AI coding tool.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac281f8a929d436eb3baad045bd795c9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac281f8a929d436eb3baad045bd795c9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1924536071abe2efc241a84fdbeae26ec73a8d8ef959a20e066a76289af39d0b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"agentmd/agent.md@e86e5c8b57d5 snapshot d9bd0b2eecce1b16","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_70eedfb6d2822b4a62dd9624b8be517b4c547c0d275064f3dbd1c2a735c82c32","slc_e9d43a368a9d726ae19f36255568308032f654ce44296c01eaf14f4bc9859ee8"],"source_ids":["src_f322e22946775c708d663f0f3ce14dea"],"text":"Tool implementers are advised to parse AGENT.md at project initialization, extract tool-relevant configuration, provide fallback behavior when absent, and respect legacy tool-specific config files.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac281f8a929d436eb3baad045bd795c9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac281f8a929d436eb3baad045bd795c9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_31369dfed15a1f082b118101b7fbc2e0c3ce440fadacc95e397947707d506799","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"agentmd/agent.md@e86e5c8b57d5 snapshot d9bd0b2eecce1b16","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_903f2e467e8505c3c5aa0c05d48b1dd959240fbe50ba1768304a89483d128b5d"],"source_ids":["src_f322e22946775c708d663f0f3ce14dea"],"text":"The document motivates AGENT.md by the proliferation of per-tool config files such as .cursorrules, .windsurfrules, and .clauderules that consumers must maintain separately.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac281f8a929d436eb3baad045bd795c9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac281f8a929d436eb3baad045bd795c9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_423251bc317b53136f55d112db08729a36f745110abf8aea6171908ed2184644","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"agentmd/agent.md@e86e5c8b57d5 snapshot d9bd0b2eecce1b16","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_206c1e1b9bce1d48e19657a10a4a68a198b20e1ce86a0dfa6c239710ab1050bd","slc_27ffc56af59b29d40263daf6d57e6dd5ad1a3db34017f561e638f9de836ff95b"],"source_ids":["src_f322e22946775c708d663f0f3ce14dea"],"text":"The spec requires AGENT.md to be placed in a project's root directory and written in Markdown, and recommends sections covering structure, commands, style, architecture, testing, and security.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac281f8a929d436eb3baad045bd795c9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac281f8a929d436eb3baad045bd795c9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5067f6b6eff20813a3338de177d6a9ae52bf24db706f45a20419e9b55659ca3c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"agentmd/agent.md@e86e5c8b57d5 snapshot d9bd0b2eecce1b16","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7bdbc13f884eafb2d2881936ea20f69435845819bdfaacbb53212ad586ef05d4"],"source_ids":["src_f322e22946775c708d663f0f3ce14dea"],"text":"When multiple AGENT.md files exist, tools should merge configurations with more specific files taking precedence over general ones.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac281f8a929d436eb3baad045bd795c9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac281f8a929d436eb3baad045bd795c9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6e090ee06d52cdccbb0096471a21af46bbbe750fba2d94e022dfa520883dc975","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"agentmd/agent.md@e86e5c8b57d5 snapshot d9bd0b2eecce1b16","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3d140a8f3a143f9f63138cb36f45734af18f7ee9f1d959fd544a7d3a304f34a1","slc_47ffe78f0dbc8f9d9e632cffb19ee6c5988f09d19b2c8dce6c477b85dc4110f7","slc_7df137932634c466027d4f87a90d5d74d75d4a512fb006af05111595679f0460","slc_de0a42f2cddd578af95ac4c74ed1e323a95030aeb77f5950834619c91580a450"],"source_ids":["src_f322e22946775c708d663f0f3ce14dea"],"text":"The document provides migration commands that move legacy configs (e.g., .clinerules, CLAUDE.md, .cursorrules) to AGENT.md and symlink the old paths back, preserving backward compatibility.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac281f8a929d436eb3baad045bd795c9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac281f8a929d436eb3baad045bd795c9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_74a173f76984863b9d0c2aca7068b073b3c3502d17ce70bee66b2ea25c5a90c3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"agentmd/agent.md@e86e5c8b57d5 snapshot d9bd0b2eecce1b16","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c7e860e508294c97283e9bf0f1e088b55036bd7789da5ac771d3b90b5d560836"],"source_ids":["src_f322e22946775c708d663f0f3ce14dea"],"text":"AGENT.md files may reference other files via @-mentions (e.g., @filename.md) to pull in additional context or documentation.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:32:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac281f8a929d436eb3baad045bd795c9"}
